    "content": "Retrofitting & reconditioning of all types of manual and CNC machines like turning centers, VMC, HMC, centerless grinding, cylindrical grinding, gear hobbing machines etc. at customer site or our premises, whichever is more convenient.\n\n### Comprehensive Reconditioning Portfolio\nWe support our clients with absolute precision across the following critical maintenance areas:\n- Servicing and reconditioning of spindles and ball screws.\n- Servicing and reconditioning of rotary tables and tail stocks.\n- Offering specialized assembly assistance.\n- Reconditioning of all types of large and small bearings.\n- Reconditioning of all types of gear boxes including planetary gear boxes.\n- Motor reconditioning.\n\nNote: We can offer all types of maintenance activities for the machines at your premises. We pride ourselves on restoring old machinery to dynamic OEM tolerances, boosting your productivity at a fraction of a new machine's purchase cost."
