    "content": "We provide various thermal processes and surface coatings for our engineering requirements. Advanced coating systems ensure maximum corrosion resistance, low wear, heat shielding, and longer operational life.\n\n### Surface Coating & Treatment Capabilities\nOur state-of-the-art coatings and heat treatments include:\n- Metalizing / Metal Plating - Plasma Spray\n- HVOF Spray - PTA & Tig Cladding\n- Hard Facing - Passivation\n- Ceramic Coating - Carbide Coating\n- Blackodizing - Passivation\n- Anodization\n\nThese treatments are engineered for heavy-duty industrial machinery, spindles, gears, and rotation systems operating in extreme environments."
